Don't forget that there is a chance of getting *any* of the above just
lying around, or from your god in the first 10 levels, sokoban and mines.
*Never* decend without exploring what is in a store either. Doing the
mines without finding out what is generated there is not a good idea
either. Sokoban less so, but don't bother with under *all* the boulders.
You also must have been pretty close to Ludios if there was one. That's
guaranteed dragon mail there.


